---
title: OTA Update Flow — Signed, Atomic, Rollback-Capable
---
flowchart TD
    A[Update server:\nnew firmware/binary\nsigned manifest] --> B[PCB/Server polls\nupdate endpoint\nHTTPS GET /manifest.json]

    B --> C{New version\navailable?}
    C -- No --> D[Sleep interval\ncheck again later]
    C -- Yes --> E[Download update bundle\nHTTPS GET /updates/v{x.y.z}.tar.zst]

    E --> F[Verify ed25519 signature\nagainst embedded public key]
    F --> G{Signature valid?}
    G -- No --> H[REJECT update\nlog: invalid signature\nalert dashboard]
    G -- Yes --> I[Verify SHA-256\nchecksum of payload]

    I --> J{Checksum match?}
    J -- No --> K[REJECT update\nlog: corrupted download\nretry once]
    J -- Yes --> L[Extract to staging\npartition / directory]

    L --> M[Run pre-update checks:\n- disk space sufficient\n- battery/power stable\n- no active gate operation]

    M --> N{Pre-checks pass?}
    N -- No --> O[Defer update\nretry after conditions met]
    N -- Yes --> P[Atomic swap:\nrename current -> rollback\nrename staging -> current]

    P --> Q[Update bootloader /\nsystemd unit to point\nto new version]

    Q --> R[Reboot service\nor full device reboot]

    R --> S[New version starts\nruns self-test]
    S --> T{Self-test pass?}
    T -- Yes --> U[Mark update SUCCESS\ndelete rollback image\nreport to dashboard]
    T -- No --> V[ROLLBACK:\nrestore rollback image\nreboot into previous version]

    V --> W[Report rollback\nto dashboard + update server]
    H --> X[Return to\nnormal operation]
    U --> X
    W --> X

    style F fill:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style P fill:#f59e0b,color:#fff
    style U fill:#16a34a,color:#fff
    style V fill:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style H fill:#dc2626,color:#fff
